    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00026",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[A42][/A42]APPLICATION USAGE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A42": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_363_07\" id=\"tag_17_363_07\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00027",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00028",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     43
    ],
    "text": "[A43][/A43]RATIONALE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A43": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_363_08\" id=\"tag_17_363_08\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00029",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     45,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I44]munmap[/I44]() function corresponds to SVR4, just as the [A45][I46]mmap[/I46]()[/A45] function\ndoes.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I44": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A45": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/mmap.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I46": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00030",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     45,
     3
    ],
    "text": "It is possible that an application has applied process memory locking to a region that contains shared memory. If this has\noccurred, the [I47]munmap[/I47]() call ignores those locks and, if necessary, causes those locks to be removed.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I47": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00031",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     45,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Most implementations require that [I48]addr[/I48] is a multiple of the page size as returned by [A49][I50]sysconf[/I50]()[/A49].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I48": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A49": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/sysconf.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I50": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00032",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     47
    ],
